    <string name="instructions">Console setup:\n\n1. Grant the \"Display over other apps\" permission — without it the lock screen will not appear on wake.\n2. Grant \"Usage access\" — it lets Pocket Lock distinguish RetroArch from emulators that need to be stopped.\n3. Settings → Security → Screen lock → set \"None\" (recommended: the lock works as an overlay with no flash of the game) or \"Swipe\".\n4. Turn on the \"Lock enabled\" switch above.\n5. Disable battery optimization so the system does not kill the background service.\n6. To have the screen turn off automatically when you do not unlock it, grant the "Device administrator" permission and choose a time in "Screen off after".\n\nUnlock: press any button or tap the screen 3 times.</string>
